From 4672db24857e1eaa74a8c87830ef3211e816f39a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:08:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] feat(google): Cloud Pub/Sub topics and pull
 subscriptions; Gmail watches publish to them

Topics with an IAM policy, pull subscriptions whose pull waits a bounded
time for a message, and acknowledgement. A watch needs its topic to let
Gmail's push service account publish, and each change to the watched
mailbox publishes {emailAddress, historyId} to it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
